7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I care about the daily reality. I'll check the state of the car at handover and the trips that repeat weekly.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Logic dictates we start with the money. I'll take last year's fuel receipts and last year's tax, insurance and parking papers.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
