30,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The fixed costs are 280,000 yen, and usage is heavily skewed toward weekends. A simple split isn't fair if some use it far more.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems that micromanaging figures creates resentment, and constant favors sour the mood. We need a system that minimizes negotiation.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The car is often left dirty or empty, and our weekly commitments are the first to fail. We need reliability over flexibility.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Shion,,The fuel spending is completely unbalanced. Some of us are subsidizing others without even knowing it. We need a precise way to track costs.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,Recording everything takes way too much time... and those heavy-use weeks are a nightmare to coordinate. I can't handle more admin.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Daisuke, if admin is the problem, we need a system that is automatic. @Shion, I agree that the fuel imbalance is a problem.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Exactly. If we try to track every single liter, we might end up in that ""accusatory"" atmosphere I discovered.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, an automatic system must ensure the car is ready for the next person. I can't have it empty on a Tuesday morning.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, while I dislike conflict, I dislike financial guesswork more. We need a method where the user pays for what they actually use.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I just... I don't want to spend my whole evening arguing about who gets the car during a busy week.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Minako,,It sounds like we are torn between precision and peace. We need to balance the financial cost with the mental load.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A fixed allocation might remove the ""favor"" aspect, but it might lead to people ""clinging to turns"" they don't need.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"A booking calendar could work, but only if the rules for handover and fuel are strictly enforced.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Shion,,A booking calendar with distance-based costs is the only logical way to solve the fuel imbalance I found.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"But @Shion, wouldn't that mean more recording? I'm worried it will just be more work for us.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Minako,,"Let's consider the options. We need to decide if we prioritize the budget, the schedule, or our sanity.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I suspect a system that reduces the need to ask for favors will be the most sustainable for our friendship.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I just want to know the car is there and usable when it's my turn.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Shion,,I'll support whatever ensures the person driving the most pays the most.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll go with whatever is the simplest to manage.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
