55,3,1,talk,Minako,,"Option A is the most stable for the budget, but Option B is fairer for usage. I lean toward B for fairness.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Option B still requires recording figures, which we know causes tension. Option A removes the need to ask favors. I vote A.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A guarantees me the car on my specific days. No more collapsing weekly trips. I vote A.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option A is financially lazy. It ignores the fuel imbalance. Option B is the only one that is logically fair. I vote B.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Option B sounds like the ""hour a week"" of recording I'm afraid of. Option A is much simpler. I vote A.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, @Asuka, @Daisuke, you all prefer A for the peace of mind. I can see that the mental cost is high.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Asuka"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It's about the long-term harmony of the group, Minako.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Asuka,,Exactly. Reliability is more valuable than a few yen of fuel difference.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Shion,,It's a disappointing choice. We're choosing convenience over honesty.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm sorry, Shion, but I just can't do more spreadsheets.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Minako,,"If we go with A, we must be strict about the handover state, or Asuka will still be unhappy.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. We can set a simple rule for cleanliness that doesn't require a ledger.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"As long as the days are fixed, I can plan my life. I'm satisfied with A.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Shion,,"I'll abstain from arguing further, but I expect the fixed share to be calculated accurately based on the 280,000 yen.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm just glad we're deciding this now.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,Minako,,It seems the consensus is clear. I will change my vote to A to ensure we all move forward together.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,A wise decision for the group's cohesion.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,4,talk,Asuka,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,4,talk,Shion,,Fine. A it is.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,Thank you everyone.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
